I added `__builtin_expect` hints so the common profile-field path (invalid cached type, valid profile/index) stays fall-through and the error/developer paths are placed out of line.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 0))
        return type;

    if (__builtin_expect((profile != NULL) && (profileIndex < profile->numFields), 1))
        return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;

    return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;
}
```